    <h1>FUM Capability: Access Management</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"sectionColumnWrapper">
 <div class=3D"sectionMacro">
  <div class=3D"sectionMacroRow">
   <div class=3D"columnMacro" style=3D"width:75%;min-width:75%;max-width:75=
%;">
    <h1 id=3D"FUMCapability:AccessManagement-Description">Description</h1>
    <hr>
    <p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge">TODO</span></p>
    <h1 id=3D"FUMCapability:AccessManagement-Context">Context</h1>
    <hr>
    <div class=3D"rwui_tabs">
     <ul class=3D"rwui_tabs_menu">
      <!-- These will be generated by the js -->
     </ul><!-- Here will the tabs go -->
     <div class=3D"rwui_tab_content" data-name=3D"10,000 Feet Overview" dat=
a-hash=3D"tab-10%2C000+Feet+Overview">
      <p><img class=3D"drawio-diagram-image" width=3D"468" style=3D"width:1=
286px;max-width: 100%;" src=3D"25b115f76b2f14bcae74588689d6b0692882955b8bc0=
b6dc316fbc901272b9f3" height=3D"292"></p>
     </div>
     <div class=3D"rwui_tab_content" data-name=3D"Business Use Cases (TO BE=
 REVIEWED)" data-hash=3D"tab-Business+Use+Cases+%28TO+BE+REVIEWED%29">
      <p><strong>Product Platform Feature Controls</strong></p>
      <p>The ability for our technical support team to turn off a feature w=
hen an incident occurs ( PrimeOE gateway is down for example, temporarily p=
revent all orders from being submitted )</p>
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"106a9b89-2895-456f-b370-695a682bef30">"Turn off tra=
ding"</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>Product Feature Package Managements</strong></p>
      <p>The ability for the product team to manage each firms ( and their =
users) features</p>
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"ed52f48b-e67d-4ce1-a075-4119e3eedcf1">Support for a=
 package with add ons features and UI visibility of package features</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"9a48c603-3865-4fff-a41b-40ac2f4895af">Support featu=
re rollouts where a feature is added and selected assigned to all users in =
a firm or role or specific users through add-on assignments</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"9a9330ff-f2d6-4c62-b78d-6e58c0b3eb2e">Support for p=
roduct feature flags to hide a feature until its ready or select which firm=
s can see it when rolling it out.&nbsp;</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>User Group Feature Management</strong></p>
      <p>The ability for the firms security steward to assign features to u=
ser from the available firm features</p>
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"1adc12f8-63dd-42ea-a34e-2de97fa0e224">Support for a=
dd ons -Assign features to specific users</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"01b9ac29-afac-4cec-82b5-7a807e81c3b6">Make the opti=
ons for add ons to be specific to firm type or selected package</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"fe16fa2a-f9e4-49aa-929f-b8d4264230bb">Support featu=
re rollouts where a feature is added and selected assigned to all users in =
a firm or role or specific users through add-on assignments</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>Data Specific Access Control</strong></p>
      <p>The ability to control features based on a users enrolment&nbsp;</=
p>
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"8b60d1d7-8322-4bd4-bcc5-a527729180ea">Sub-advisor (=
 RR Code/Firm Specific Feature Activity )</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"6a21f4a5-ad2c-4449-bfdd-382f3c74e509">Product Featu=
res ( solicitation reporting, customize commissions )</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"1b88f0ad-0a5e-48e7-a75f-1d384de8e279">Features base=
d on your currently selected firm when you have the ability to move between=
 firms ( Users only have the ability to update the brand for client firms a=
nd not nbin, or we rolled out the ability to export and upload users in the=
 NBIN firm only, so when you switch firms you should have that feature )</l=
i>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>Additional</strong></p>
      <p>Capability to segregate feature offerings or add-on features by Fi=
rm segments (e.g. size, total AUM)</p>
     </div>
     <div class=3D"rwui_tab_content" data-name=3D"Technical Use Cases" data=
-hash=3D"tab-Technical+Use+Cases">
      <p><img class=3D"drawio-diagram-image" width=3D"468" style=3D"width:1=
141px;max-width: 100%;" src=3D"73b4188f0b2fb687811e2ed418d44f6065f64708d552=
49dc4274289b7a52904b" height=3D"480"></p>
     </div>
    </div>
    <p><br></p>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"columnMacro" style=3D"width:25%;min-width:25%;max-width:25=
%;">
